IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `bn-registration`

-- Business Names Registration Act 2011 (Cth) -- worked cases from the seat of the business owner (Daniel's company,
-- Jarrah Legal Technologies Pty Ltd, registering a business name, d043, 2031; and ordinary owners around it).
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked against a
-- decided case, an ASIC practice or the Minister's instruments (not deposited).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad
-- gen_business-names-registration-act-2011_baseline.py). Expected results were written by hand from the text.
--
-- Facts the life does not state are ASSUMPTIONS, labelled where used: that Jarrah trades under a name other than its own
-- full company name (here "Jarrah Legal"); that the name is free of conflicts, undesirable kinds and restricted words;
-- that Jarrah has its ABN and pays the fee when it applies; that no one involved in its management has a disqualifying
-- conviction.

§ `fixtures`

